  <item>
    <title>04）陶醉在春风里时，怎能没有音乐呢？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/643aa9029361a4e7c39f3d27</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">643aa9029361a4e7c39f3d27</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Apr 2023 13:39:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>万万没想到，小小节目竟然参与串台了</span></p><span></span><p><span>而且，还是有奖品的！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目非常感谢【创意玩具】主播Roger的邀请，有幸和【大兔公园门口】的兔毛主播、大维主播一起聊音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>特附上另外两档播客传送门：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ca2f9821a514053c1e73e9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/60ca2f9821a514053c1e73e9"><span>创意玩具</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/624ee875d01d114df44b162a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/624ee875d01d114df44b162a"><span>大兔公园门口</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>接下来进入本期节目正题！</span></p><span></span><p><span>-时间轴-</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们请ChatGPT赋诗三首：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part I 晚春初夏的凉夜，来品荔枝绿茶</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>绿茶初泡薰香满，荔枝剥开甘露溅</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>红绿相映人心醉，清香浸润意自甜</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>周杰伦 - 爷爷泡的茶 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>五月天 - 温柔 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>飞儿乐队 - 你的微笑 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>陈绮贞 - 微凉的你 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>苏打绿 - 日光 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>罗大佑 - 童年 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>裘德 - 荔枝 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part II 盛夏夜，浆果聚会</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>盛夏浆果鲜红色，洛神艳丽满枝翠</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>清凉一口味蕴香，滋润人心暑气退</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>童安格 - 耶利亚女郎 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2203">36:43</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>莫文蔚 - 盛夏的果实 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">41:53</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>朴树 - 生如夏花 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2771">46:11</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>徐佳莹，黄瑞丰 - 二日醉 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3203">53:23</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>梁静茹 - 宁夏 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>五月天 - 知足 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3736">01:02:16</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part III 下雪的冬夜，围坐一锅热红酒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>寒冬红酒醇厚香，独坐窗前赏雪芳</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>酒入温暖心底起，满怀欢喜乐悠扬</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>王若琳 - 亲密爱人 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4120">01:08:40</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>王若琳 - 我只在乎你 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4413">01:13:33</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>孙燕姿 - 遇见 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4562">01:16:02</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>范晓萱 - 雪人 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4917">01:21:57</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>薛之谦 - 认真的雪 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5196">01:26:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>9m88，LAYTON WU - A Merry Feeling <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5571">01:32:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>方大同 - 红豆 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5816">01:36:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-福利派送-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>①Jollee风味葡萄酒「三瓶装」声浪计划听友到手价：139元</span></p><span></span><p><span>②在本期【大兔公园门口】节目的评论区分享你的音乐回忆，选1位幸运听友送出价值169元的Jollee风味葡萄酒三瓶装（4月22日开奖）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>复制下方口令或链接在手淘打开即可领券下单</span></p><span></span><p><span>￥2wDCdl1qZmO￥ m.tb.cn</span></p><span></span><p><span>或前往🍑jollee官方旗舰店找客服报暗号「声浪计划」领取独家优惠券</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fom5LzoT52oxnmTR2dUaWnLfotW5.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBEF6JMQebrU_bDGhcXT8UwKNTM.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftfgdq_wn0stWQmM_uHPK9wpxAkq.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
